# Test Governance (always-on)

- Never claim tests passed unless you ran them.
- If tests were not run, say so explicitly.
- Prefer the **smallest relevant** verification for the task (e.g. `pytest path::test` before full gate).
- Do not expand test scope unless the task requires it.
- Do not create new test files without explicit user approval.

Full policy: [docs/agent-testing-policy.md](mdc:docs/agent-testing-policy.md). Command table: attach `40-testing-gates` via `00-core` rules index.
